build*
# `build*` is meant for the CMake build directories; a cargo build
# script is a source file that happens to match it.
!bindings/rust/*/build.rs
war3.w3mod
prebuilt/debug_shaders/
stage*
.pyc
__pycache__
bindings/rust/target/
# Staged by scripts/vendor-rust.ps1 for `cargo publish`; regenerated, never edited.
bindings/rust/whiteoutflakes-sys/vendor/
bindings/rust/whiteoutflakes-shaders-*/pack/
# Generated by tools/d3_shader_atlas/d3_uber_perms.py: 2,848 extracted shader
# permutations plus whatever the reconstruction agents write beside them.
# Regenerated from the atlas in one command, so it is not worth 62 MB of history.
d3_re_shaders
agent_logs_d3
tools/d3_particle_oracle
tools/d3_shader_atlas
tools/sc2_ribbon_oracle
tools/sc2_particle_oracle
tools/war3_oracle
